$F69B c PlaySound ; Start effect E (through PlaySoundVector), every register kept
> Witness: L1 3076 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r1-rzx-r5).

