> Witness: L1 3100 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, joystick, s1-idle, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r1-rzx-r5).

$F78A c AyFrame ; Every frame: step the three channels, write their periods (a noise channel: the period's low byte to register 6)
> Witness: L1 125689 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, joystick, menu, s1-idle, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r0-rzx-r5).
$F79B AyFrameChannel
$F7BF AyFrameNoise
$F7C7 AyFrameNext

$F7DE c ChannelStep ; One frame of the channel at IX: write its volume, move its period and volume, the next segment
> Witness: L1 377598 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, joystick, menu, s1-idle, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r0-rzx-r5).
$F817 ChannelNextSegment
$F833 ChannelDone ; the last segment: volume 0, the channel idle

$F843 c WriteVolume ; AY volume of the current channel := its volume / 16
> Witness: L1 24735 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r1-rzx-r5).

$F854 c AyWrite ; AY register D := E
> Witness: L1 79117 (c1, c1o, deaths, ending, joystick, s1-idle, s1-right, s2-right, s3-right, s4-right, s5-right, stageload, rzx-r1-rzx-r5).

$F85E b Channels 8 ; The three channels, 8 bytes each
> +0 segments left ($FF idle), +1 frames left in the segment, +2 the segment's address, +4 the period, +6 the noise flag (0 a tone), +7 the volume x 16. Read and written by StartEffect, AyFrame and ChannelStep.
$F866 Channel2
$F86E Channel3

